5:["$","p","The courses are designed in smaller, manageable learning units, making them suitable for learners who may already be balancing school, university, employment, internships, or family responsibilities.",{"children":"The courses are designed in smaller, manageable learning units, making them suitable for learners who may already be balancing school, university, employment, internships, or family responsibilities."}]
6:["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]
7:["$","section","Wichita State University Digital Badge Program 2026: Key Highlights",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Wichita State University Digital Badge Program 2026: Key Highlights"}],[["$","p","The 2026 badge opportunity includes the following benefits:",{"children":"The 2026 badge opportunity includes the following benefits:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
8:["$","section","Most courses offered through the campaign are fully scholarship-funded, subject to availability",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most courses offered through the campaign are fully scholarship-funded, subject to availability"}],[["$","p","Fully online and self-paced learning",{"children":"Fully online and self-paced learning"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
9:["$","section","The ability to display the badge on LinkedIn, a résumé, and a professional portfolio",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The ability to display the badge on LinkedIn, a résumé, and a professional portfolio"}],[["$","p","Access for students, professionals, and lifelong learners",{"children":"Access for students, professionals, and lifelong learners"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
a:["$","section","Flexible course commencement after the program begins, provided all work is completed before the final deadline",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Flexible course commencement after the program begins, provided all work is completed before the final deadline"}],[["$","p","The exact workload, requirements, credit value, and scholarship coverage may differ by course. Wichita State University states that badges are generally worth 0.5 or 1 credit hour, and applicants should review the details of their selected course before enrolling. (Wichita State University)",{"children":"The exact workload, requirements, credit value, and scholarship coverage may differ by course. Wichita State University states that badges are generally worth 0.5 or 1 credit hour, and applicants should review the details of their selected course before enrolling. (Wichita State University)"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
b:["$","section","Why Digital Badges Matter in 2026",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why Digital Badges Matter in 2026"}],[["$","p","Education and recruitment are becoming increasingly skills-focused. Employers want to understand not only what qualification a candidate holds but also what the candidate can actually do.",{"children":"Education and recruitment are becoming increasingly skills-focused. Employers want to understand not only what qualification a candidate holds but also what the candidate can actually do."}],["$","p","A digital badge allows you to demonstrate learning in a specific area without committing to another full-time degree or long-term academic program. It can show that you have taken the initiative to learn beyond your existing curriculum or job responsibilities.",{"children":"A digital badge allows you to demonstrate learning in a specific area without committing to another full-time degree or long-term academic program. It can show that you have taken the initiative to learn beyond your existing curriculum or job responsibilities."}],["$","p","For example, a student may study Engineering but complete a badge in professional communication. A Business student may explore social media or globalisation. A working professional may strengthen skills related to employee performance, recruitment, exporting, cultural competency, or online presentations.",{"children":"For example, a student may study Engineering but complete a badge in professional communication. A Business student may explore social media or globalisation. A working professional may strengthen skills related to employee performance, recruitment, exporting, cultural competency, or online presentations."}],["$","p","This combination of core education and supplementary learning can help create a more versatile profile.",{"children":"This combination of core education and supplementary learning can help create a more versatile profile."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
c:["$","section","How Can the WSU Digital Badge Program Help Your Career?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How Can the WSU Digital Badge Program Help Your Career?"}],[["$","p","One of the qualities valued by employers is the willingness to keep learning.",{"children":"One of the qualities valued by employers is the willingness to keep learning."}],["$","p","Technology, communication methods, workplace expectations, and industry practices continue to change. Candidates who actively develop new skills may be better prepared to respond to these changes.",{"children":"Technology, communication methods, workplace expectations, and industry practices continue to change. Candidates who actively develop new skills may be better prepared to respond to these changes."}],["$","p","Completing a digital badge tells employers that you did not wait for your college or organisation to provide every learning opportunity. You identified a useful area, committed time to it, completed the required work, and earned a formal credential.",{"children":"Completing a digital badge tells employers that you did not wait for your college or organisation to provide every learning opportunity. You identified a useful area, committed time to it, completed the required work, and earned a formal credential."}],["$","p","This can reflect qualities such as:",{"children":"This can reflect qualities such as:"}],["$","p","Self-motivation",{"children":"Self-motivation"}],["$","p","Time management",{"children":"Time management"}],["$","p","Curiosity",{"children":"Curiosity"}],["$","p","Professional discipline",{"children":"Professional discipline"}],["$","p","Adaptability",{"children":"Adaptability"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","It Can Demonstrate Your Commitment to Continuous Learning",{"children":"It Can Demonstrate Your Commitment to Continuous Learning"}]]}]]}]
d:["$","section","Willingness to learn independently",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Willingness to learn independently"}],[["$","p","The badge alone will not guarantee employment. However, when it is supported by projects, assignments, internships, academic performance, and clear career goals, it can strengthen the overall impression you create.",{"children":"The badge alone will not guarantee employment. However, when it is supported by projects, assignments, internships, academic performance, and clear career goals, it can strengthen the overall impression you create."}],["$","p","Many résumés contain broad statements such as “good communication skills,” “interested in business,” or “familiar with social media.” These claims become more credible when they are supported by relevant learning or practical work.",{"children":"Many résumés contain broad statements such as “good communication skills,” “interested in business,” or “familiar with social media.” These claims become more credible when they are supported by relevant learning or practical work."}],["$","p","A badge can provide structured evidence that you have studied a specific subject.",{"children":"A badge can provide structured evidence that you have studied a specific subject."}],["$","p","For example:",{"children":"For example:"}],["$","p","Wichita State University – Professional Writing: Crafting Your Résumé and Cover Letter",{"children":"Wichita State University – Professional Writing: Crafting Your Résumé and Cover Letter"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","It Can Add a Focused Skill to Your Résumé",{"children":"It Can Add a Focused Skill to Your Résumé"}]]}]]}]
e:["$","section","Digital Badge, 2026",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Digital Badge, 2026"}],[["$","p","You can also add one or two relevant learning outcomes below the badge:",{"children":"You can also add one or two relevant learning outcomes below the badge:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
f:["$","section","Learned to analyse job descriptions and tailor application documents",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Learned to analyse job descriptions and tailor application documents"}],[["$","p","Wichita State University’s résumé and cover-letter badge, for example, includes learning related to professional documents, job listings, persuasive content, grammar, conciseness, and the development of an effective résumé and cover letter. (",{"children":"Wichita State University’s résumé and cover-letter badge, for example, includes learning related to professional documents, job listings, persuasive content, grammar, conciseness, and the development of an effective résumé and cover letter. ("}],["$","p","Wichita State University",{"children":"Wichita State University"}],["$","p",")",{"children":")"}],["$","p","The key is not to merely mention the badge. Explain what you learned and how it connects with your career direction.",{"children":"The key is not to merely mention the badge. Explain what you learned and how it connects with your career direction."}],["$","p","LinkedIn has become an important professional platform for students, graduates, jobseekers, and working professionals.",{"children":"LinkedIn has become an important professional platform for students, graduates, jobseekers, and working professionals."}],["$","p","After completing your badge, you may add it to the Licences and Certifications section of your profile. You can include:",{"children":"After completing your badge, you may add it to the Licences and Certifications section of your profile. You can include:"}],["$","p","Name of the badge",{"children":"Name of the badge"}],["$","p","Issuing organisation: Wichita State University",{"children":"Issuing organisation: Wichita State University"}],["$","p","Date of completion",{"children":"Date of completion"}],["$","p","Credential link or identifier, where available",{"children":"Credential link or identifier, where available"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","It Can Strengthen Your LinkedIn Profile",{"children":"It Can Strengthen Your LinkedIn Profile"}]]}]]}]
10:["$","section","Skills connected with the course",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Skills connected with the course"}],[["$","p","You can also publish a brief LinkedIn post about your experience. Instead of simply writing, “I am happy to share that I completed a course,” explain:",{"children":"You can also publish a brief LinkedIn post about your experience. Instead of simply writing, “I am happy to share that I completed a course,” explain:"}],["$","p","Why you selected the badge",{"children":"Why you selected the badge"}],["$","p","What you learned",{"children":"What you learned"}],["$","p","Which assignment or topic was most useful",{"children":"Which assignment or topic was most useful"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
11:["$","section","How the badge relates to your academic or professional goals",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How the badge relates to your academic or professional goals"}],[["$","p","A thoughtful post can make the credential more meaningful and may also help you begin conversations with classmates, recruiters, mentors, and professionals in your field.",{"children":"A thoughtful post can make the credential more meaningful and may also help you begin conversations with classmates, recruiters, mentors, and professionals in your field."}],["$","p","Interviewers frequently ask questions such as:",{"children":"Interviewers frequently ask questions such as:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","It Can Give You Something Meaningful to Discuss in Interviews",{"children":"It Can Give You Something Meaningful to Discuss in Interviews"}]]}]]}]
12:["$","section","How have you prepared for this role?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How have you prepared for this role?"}],[["$","p","Tell us about a new skill you recently learned.",{"children":"Tell us about a new skill you recently learned."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
13:["$","section","Why are you interested in this field?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why are you interested in this field?"}],[["$","p","A completed badge can provide a practical example for answering these questions.",{"children":"A completed badge can provide a practical example for answering these questions."}],["$","p","For instance, you could say:",{"children":"For instance, you could say:"}],["$","p","“Alongside my regular studies, I completed a digital badge from Wichita State University in online presentations. The course helped me understand how to organise presentation material, communicate effectively in a virtual environment, and improve the clarity of my delivery. I later applied those principles while presenting a college project.”",{"children":"“Alongside my regular studies, I completed a digital badge from Wichita State University in online presentations. The course helped me understand how to organise presentation material, communicate effectively in a virtual environment, and improve the clarity of my delivery. I later applied those principles while presenting a college project.”"}],["$","p","This is stronger than simply listing a badge because it connects your learning with an actual experience.",{"children":"This is stronger than simply listing a badge because it connects your learning with an actual experience."}],["$","p","Students are often expected to choose a specialisation or career path before they have had enough exposure to different fields.",{"children":"Students are often expected to choose a specialisation or career path before they have had enough exposure to different fields."}],["$","p","A short badge course can help you explore an area without immediately committing to a full degree, diploma, or expensive certification.",{"children":"A short badge course can help you explore an area without immediately committing to a full degree, diploma, or expensive certification."}],["$","p","For example:",{"children":"For example:"}],["$","p","A student considering Human Resources can explore recruitment, job design, or performance management.",{"children":"A student considering Human Resources can explore recruitment, job design, or performance management."}],["$","p","A learner interested in international business can study exporting, globalisation, or entering foreign markets.",{"children":"A learner interested in international business can study exporting, globalisation, or entering foreign markets."}],["$","p","A healthcare aspirant can explore medical terminology or culturally competent service delivery.",{"children":"A healthcare aspirant can explore medical terminology or culturally competent service delivery."}],["$","p","A student interested in content and communication can study professional writing, social media editing, or online presentations.",{"children":"A student interested in content and communication can study professional writing, social media editing, or online presentations."}],["$","p","An engineering learner can explore a focused technical topic beyond the regular curriculum.",{"children":"An engineering learner can explore a focused technical topic beyond the regular curriculum."}],["$","p","The experience may either confirm your interest or help you realise that another field is more suitable. Both outcomes are valuable when planning your education and career.",{"children":"The experience may either confirm your interest or help you realise that another field is more suitable. Both outcomes are valuable when planning your education and career."}],"$L47","$L48","$L49","$L4a","$L4b","$L4c","$L4d","$L4e"],"$L4f"]}]
14:["$","section","Evidence of initiative",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Evidence of initiative"}],[["$","p","A relevant WSU badge can become one additional piece of evidence that supports your application.",{"children":"A relevant WSU badge can become one additional piece of evidence that supports your application."}],["$","p","For example, a student applying for a marketing internship may benefit from a badge related to professional social media. A student applying for an HR internship may select recruitment or employee-performance coursework. A candidate applying for an international-business opportunity may choose exporting, globalisation, or foreign-market entry.",{"children":"For example, a student applying for a marketing internship may benefit from a badge related to professional social media. A student applying for an HR internship may select recruitment or employee-performance coursework. A candidate applying for an international-business opportunity may choose exporting, globalisation, or foreign-market entry."}],["$","p","The badge should complement the role you are targeting. Selecting a course simply because it is available may be less useful than choosing one connected with your intended career.",{"children":"The badge should complement the role you are targeting. Selecting a course simply because it is available may be less useful than choosing one connected with your intended career."}],["$","p","Modern careers do not always remain within the boundaries of a single academic discipline.",{"children":"Modern careers do not always remain within the boundaries of a single academic discipline."}],["$","p","An engineer may need communication and business skills. A healthcare professional may need cultural awareness and leadership skills. A business graduate may need digital communication and data-related capabilities. A content professional may need knowledge of branding, social media, and audience behaviour.",{"children":"An engineer may need communication and business skills. A healthcare professional may need cultural awareness and leadership skills. A business graduate may need digital communication and data-related capabilities. A content professional may need knowledge of branding, social media, and audience behaviour."}],["$","p","A badge allows you to add a complementary skill to your main qualification.",{"children":"A badge allows you to add a complementary skill to your main qualification."}],["$","p","This can be especially beneficial for students who want to create an interdisciplinary profile, such as:",{"children":"This can be especially beneficial for students who want to create an interdisciplinary profile, such as:"}],["$","p","Engineering and business",{"children":"Engineering and business"}],["$","p","Healthcare and communication",{"children":"Healthcare and communication"}],["$","p","Technology and professional writing",{"children":"Technology and professional writing"}],["$","p","Business and social media",{"children":"Business and social media"}],["$","p","Psychology and cultural competency",{"children":"Psychology and cultural competency"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","It Can Help You Build a More Interdisciplinary Profile",{"children":"It Can Help You Build a More Interdisciplinary Profile"}]]}]]}]
15:["$","section","Management and global affairs",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Management and global affairs"}],[["$","p","For students considering higher education in the United States, an online badge course can provide limited but useful exposure to an American university’s learning system.",{"children":"For students considering higher education in the United States, an online badge course can provide limited but useful exposure to an American university’s learning system."}],["$","p","Depending on the course, students may experience:",{"children":"Depending on the course, students may experience:"}],["$","p","Online university learning platforms",{"children":"Online university learning platforms"}],["$","p","Assignment-based assessment",{"children":"Assignment-based assessment"}],["$","p","Independent study",{"children":"Independent study"}],["$","p","Academic deadlines",{"children":"Academic deadlines"}],["$","p","University communication systems",{"children":"University communication systems"}],["$","p","Applied learning activities",{"children":"Applied learning activities"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","It Can Introduce You to a US University Learning Environment",{"children":"It Can Introduce You to a US University Learning Environment"}]]}]]}]
16:["$","section","Instructor expectations",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Instructor expectations"}],[["$","p","The badge program should not be viewed as equivalent to completing a full degree or studying on campus. However, it can offer an introduction to international online learning and help students become more comfortable with independent academic work.",{"children":"The badge program should not be viewed as equivalent to completing a full degree or studying on campus. However, it can offer an introduction to international online learning and help students become more comfortable with independent academic work."}],["$","p","WSU’s international badge information describes the courses as an opportunity for students to gain exposure to a US university class experience. (Wichita State University)",{"children":"WSU’s international badge information describes the courses as an opportunity for students to gain exposure to a US university class experience. (Wichita State University)"}],["$","p","Digital credentials are most valuable when the learner can demonstrate who issued them and what was required to earn them.",{"children":"Digital credentials are most valuable when the learner can demonstrate who issued them and what was required to earn them."}],["$","p","Wichita State University states that successful learners receive a digital recognition that can be shared on social media or connected to a digital résumé. The academic work also appears on the student’s transcript. (Wichita State University)",{"children":"Wichita State University states that successful learners receive a digital recognition that can be shared on social media or connected to a digital résumé. The academic work also appears on the student’s transcript. (Wichita State University)"}],["$","p","This provides greater credibility than simply mentioning that you watched online videos or informally studied a subject.",{"children":"This provides greater credibility than simply mentioning that you watched online videos or informally studied a subject."}],["$","p","However, learners must successfully complete all course requirements. Students who do not complete the required work may receive an “NBG,” or no badge earned, notation. Badge results do not affect the student’s GPA. (Wichita State University)",{"children":"However, learners must successfully complete all course requirements. Students who do not complete the required work may receive an “NBG,” or no badge earned, notation. Badge results do not affect the student’s GPA. (Wichita State University)"}],["$","p","Who Should Consider the WSU Digital Badge Program?",{"children":"Who Should Consider the WSU Digital Badge Program?"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","It Provides a Credential That Can Be Verified",{"children":"It Provides a Credential That Can Be Verified"}]]}]]}]
17:["$","section","School and Undergraduate Students",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"School and Undergraduate Students"}],[["$","p","The program may help students explore subjects beyond their existing curriculum, build independent-learning habits, and begin developing a stronger academic and extracurricular profile.",{"children":"The program may help students explore subjects beyond their existing curriculum, build independent-learning habits, and begin developing a stronger academic and extracurricular profile."}],["$","p","Students under the required age should confirm the supervision and eligibility conditions before registering.",{"children":"Students under the required age should confirm the supervision and eligibility conditions before registering."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
18:["$","section","University Graduates and Jobseekers",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"University Graduates and Jobseekers"}],[["$","p","Graduates may select badges that complement their degree or relate to the roles they are targeting. The credential can be added to a résumé and discussed during interviews.",{"children":"Graduates may select badges that complement their degree or relate to the roles they are targeting. The credential can be added to a résumé and discussed during interviews."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
19:["$","section","Working Professionals",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Working Professionals"}],[["$","p","Professionals can use badge courses to refresh existing knowledge, explore a new responsibility, or add a specialised skill without interrupting their employment.",{"children":"Professionals can use badge courses to refresh existing knowledge, explore a new responsibility, or add a specialised skill without interrupting their employment."}],["$","p","WSU states that its badge program was developed with working professionals in mind and that coursework is structured in smaller, manageable units. (Wichita State University Catalog)",{"children":"WSU states that its badge program was developed with working professionals in mind and that coursework is structured in smaller, manageable units. (Wichita State University Catalog)"}],["$","p","Career Changers",{"children":"Career Changers"}],["$","p","A badge can serve as an introductory step for professionals considering a different field. It cannot replace the qualifications required for regulated or highly specialised careers, but it may help learners assess their interest and begin building foundational knowledge.",{"children":"A badge can serve as an introductory step for professionals considering a different field. It cannot replace the qualifications required for regulated or highly specialised careers, but it may help learners assess their interest and begin building foundational knowledge."}],["$","p","Lifelong Learners",{"children":"Lifelong Learners"}],["$","p","Not every learner is pursuing a promotion, degree, or job change. Some may simply want to understand a new subject, improve communication, or remain intellectually active.",{"children":"Not every learner is pursuing a promotion, degree, or job change. Some may simply want to understand a new subject, improve communication, or remain intellectually active."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1a:["$","section","What Types of Badge Courses Are Available?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What Types of Badge Courses Are Available?"}],[["$","p","The final 2026 course list may depend on scholarship allocations and seat availability. The opportunity is expected to include more than 30 courses across several broad areas.",{"children":"The final 2026 course list may depend on scholarship allocations and seat availability. The opportunity is expected to include more than 30 courses across several broad areas."}],["$","p","Engineering",{"children":"Engineering"}],["$","p","Engineering-related badges may help learners explore specialised technical concepts, analytical approaches, programming, optimisation, or other applied areas.",{"children":"Engineering-related badges may help learners explore specialised technical concepts, analytical approaches, programming, optimisation, or other applied areas."}],["$","p","These courses may be particularly useful for engineering students who want exposure beyond their university syllabus.",{"children":"These courses may be particularly useful for engineering students who want exposure beyond their university syllabus."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","Business and Management",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Business and Management"}],[["$","p","Business badges may include subjects connected with:",{"children":"Business badges may include subjects connected with:"}],["$","p","Human resource management",{"children":"Human resource management"}],["$","p","Recruitment",{"children":"Recruitment"}],["$","p","Employee performance",{"children":"Employee performance"}],["$","p","Job design",{"children":"Job design"}],["$","p","Global business",{"children":"Global business"}],["$","p","Exporting",{"children":"Exporting"}],["$","p","Foreign-market entry",{"children":"Foreign-market entry"}],["$","p","Globalisation",{"children":"Globalisation"}],["$","p","These subjects can be relevant to students considering careers in management, HR, consulting, entrepreneurship, international business, and operations.",{"children":"These subjects can be relevant to students considering careers in management, HR, consulting, entrepreneurship, international business, and operations."}],["$","p","Professional Writing and Communication",{"children":"Professional Writing and Communication"}],["$","p","Possible areas include:",{"children":"Possible areas include:"}],["$","p","Résumé and cover-letter writing",{"children":"Résumé and cover-letter writing"}],["$","p","Professional correspondence",{"children":"Professional correspondence"}],["$","p","Online presentations",{"children":"Online presentations"}],["$","p","Social-media editing",{"children":"Social-media editing"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","Workplace communication",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Workplace communication"}],[["$","p","These skills are useful across industries because professionals are regularly expected to write emails, prepare documents, present ideas, and communicate online.",{"children":"These skills are useful across industries because professionals are regularly expected to write emails, prepare documents, present ideas, and communicate online."}],["$","p","Health Sciences",{"children":"Health Sciences"}],["$","p","Health-related badges may introduce learners to areas such as medical terminology, healthcare communication, care services, or professional competencies relevant to health and social-service settings.",{"children":"Health-related badges may introduce learners to areas such as medical terminology, healthcare communication, care services, or professional competencies relevant to health and social-service settings."}],["$","p","A short badge does not provide a medical licence or replace formal healthcare qualifications. It should be viewed as supplementary learning.",{"children":"A short badge does not provide a medical licence or replace formal healthcare qualifications. It should be viewed as supplementary learning."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","Behavioural and Social Sciences",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Behavioural and Social Sciences"}],[["$","p","Learners may find courses related to cultural competency, intersectionality, service delivery, criminal justice, or other behavioural and community-oriented topics.",{"children":"Learners may find courses related to cultural competency, intersectionality, service delivery, criminal justice, or other behavioural and community-oriented topics."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","Social Media and Workforce Skills",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Social Media and Workforce Skills"}],[["$","p","These badges may help learners improve their professional online presence, understand workplace expectations, or strengthen general employability skills.",{"children":"These badges may help learners improve their professional online presence, understand workplace expectations, or strengthen general employability skills."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","How to Choose the Right Badge for Your Career",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to Choose the Right Badge for Your Career"}],[["$","p","The best badge is not necessarily the most technical or popular one. It is the course that fits your current stage and future direction.",{"children":"The best badge is not necessarily the most technical or popular one. It is the course that fits your current stage and future direction."}],["$","p","Before selecting a badge, ask yourself:",{"children":"Before selecting a badge, ask yourself:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
20:["$","section","What career or academic goal am I working towards?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What career or academic goal am I working towards?"}],[["$","p","Choose a course that supports a real goal, such as preparing for an internship, improving communication, exploring HR, entering healthcare, or strengthening an engineering profile.",{"children":"Choose a course that supports a real goal, such as preparing for an internship, improving communication, exploring HR, entering healthcare, or strengthening an engineering profile."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
21:["$","section","What skill is currently missing from my profile?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What skill is currently missing from my profile?"}],[["$","p","Review your résumé and identify a gap. It may be technical knowledge, professional writing, presentation ability, social-media professionalism, or understanding of a particular industry.",{"children":"Review your résumé and identify a gap. It may be technical knowledge, professional writing, presentation ability, social-media professionalism, or understanding of a particular industry."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
22:["$","section","Can I explain why I selected this badge?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Can I explain why I selected this badge?"}],[["$","p","You should be able to explain the connection between the course and your goals in one or two clear sentences.",{"children":"You should be able to explain the connection between the course and your goals in one or two clear sentences."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
23:["$","section","Will I have enough time to complete it?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Will I have enough time to complete it?"}],[["$","p","Self-paced does not mean that there is no deadline. You will need to complete the learning activities and assignments before the course-completion date.",{"children":"Self-paced does not mean that there is no deadline. You will need to complete the learning activities and assignments before the course-completion date."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
24:["$","section","Can I apply the learning?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Can I apply the learning?"}],[["$","p","Choose a badge that allows you to create or improve something practical, such as a résumé, presentation, LinkedIn profile, job description, recruitment plan, or technical exercise.",{"children":"Choose a badge that allows you to create or improve something practical, such as a résumé, presentation, LinkedIn profile, job description, recruitment plan, or technical exercise."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
25:["$","section","How to Make the Badge More Valuable After Completion",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to Make the Badge More Valuable After Completion"}],[["$","p","Simply earning the badge is only the first step. The career value comes from how you apply and communicate what you learned.",{"children":"Simply earning the badge is only the first step. The career value comes from how you apply and communicate what you learned."}],["$","p","Add It to Your Résumé",{"children":"Add It to Your Résumé"}],["$","p","Create a section titled:",{"children":"Create a section titled:"}],["$","p","Certifications and Digital Credentials",{"children":"Certifications and Digital Credentials"}],["$","p","Professional Development",{"children":"Professional Development"}],["$","p","Additional Education",{"children":"Additional Education"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
26:["$","section","Courses and Credentials",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Courses and Credentials"}],[["$","p","Mention the full badge title, Wichita State University, and the year of completion.",{"children":"Mention the full badge title, Wichita State University, and the year of completion."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
27:["$","section","Update Your LinkedIn Profile",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Update Your LinkedIn Profile"}],[["$","p","Add the badge under Licences and Certifications and connect it with the most relevant skills on your profile.",{"children":"Add the badge under Licences and Certifications and connect it with the most relevant skills on your profile."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
28:["$","section","Save Your Assignments",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Save Your Assignments"}],[["$","p","Where permitted, retain copies of projects, presentations, written exercises, or action plans developed during the course. These may become useful portfolio materials.",{"children":"Where permitted, retain copies of projects, presentations, written exercises, or action plans developed during the course. These may become useful portfolio materials."}],["$","p","Do not publicly share protected course material or assignments if the university does not permit it.",{"children":"Do not publicly share protected course material or assignments if the university does not permit it."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
29:["$","section","Apply the Learning to a Project",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Apply the Learning to a Project"}],[["$","p","Use the skill in a college project, internship, volunteering assignment, workplace responsibility, personal portfolio, or professional activity.",{"children":"Use the skill in a college project, internship, volunteering assignment, workplace responsibility, personal portfolio, or professional activity."}],["$","p","Prepare an Interview Explanation",{"children":"Prepare an Interview Explanation"}],["$","p","Be ready to explain:",{"children":"Be ready to explain:"}],["$","p","Why you selected the course",{"children":"Why you selected the course"}],["$","p","What you learned",{"children":"What you learned"}],["$","p","What assignment you completed",{"children":"What assignment you completed"}],["$","p","How you applied the knowledge",{"children":"How you applied the knowledge"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2a:["$","section","How it supports your future goals",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How it supports your future goals"}],[["$","p","This turns the badge from a line on your résumé into a meaningful career story.",{"children":"This turns the badge from a line on your résumé into a meaningful career story."}],["$","p","Important Dates for the 2026 Program",{"children":"Important Dates for the 2026 Program"}],["$","p","Program Begins:",{"children":"Program Begins:"}],["$","p","17 August 2026",{"children":"17 August 2026"}],["$","p","Registration Deadline:",{"children":"Registration Deadline:"}],["$","p","11 September 2026",{"children":"11 September 2026"}],["$","p","Course Completion Deadline:",{"children":"Course Completion Deadline:"}],["$","p","3 December 2026",{"children":"3 December 2026"}],["$","p","Applications may close before the stated deadline once available seats are filled. Interested learners are therefore encouraged to register early.",{"children":"Applications may close before the stated deadline once available seats are filled. Interested learners are therefore encouraged to register early."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2b:["$","section","Is the WSU Digital Badge Program completely online?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Is the WSU Digital Badge Program completely online?"}],[["$","p","Yes. Wichita State University currently describes its badge courses as online, and the 2026 international opportunity is intended to be fully online and self-paced. (Wichita State University)",{"children":"Yes. Wichita State University currently describes its badge courses as online, and the 2026 international opportunity is intended to be fully online and self-paced. (Wichita State University)"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2c:["$","section","Do I need TOEFL or IELTS?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Do I need TOEFL or IELTS?"}],[["$","p","No TOEFL or IELTS score is required for the international badge opportunity.",{"children":"No TOEFL or IELTS score is required for the international badge opportunity."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2d:["$","section","Are the badge courses free?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Are the badge courses free?"}],[["$","p","Most courses available through the 2026 campaign are scholarship-funded. Scholarship availability may depend on the selected course, available seats, and final approval. Applicants should confirm the coverage applicable to their selected badge before completing enrolment.",{"children":"Most courses available through the 2026 campaign are scholarship-funded. Scholarship availability may depend on the selected course, available seats, and final approval. Applicants should confirm the coverage applicable to their selected badge before completing enrolment."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2e:["$","section","Will I receive a certificate?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Will I receive a certificate?"}],[["$","p","Successful learners receive a digital badge issued by Wichita State University. The completed academic work may also be reflected on the learner’s WSU transcript. It is more accurate to call it a digital badge rather than a degree or professional certificate. (Wichita State University)",{"children":"Successful learners receive a digital badge issued by Wichita State University. The completed academic work may also be reflected on the learner’s WSU transcript. It is more accurate to call it a digital badge rather than a degree or professional certificate. (Wichita State University)"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2f:["$","section","Will the badge affect my GPA?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Will the badge affect my GPA?"}],[["$","p","No. Badge courses are recorded as BG, meaning badge earned, or NBG, meaning no badge earned. They do not affect the learner’s GPA. (Wichita State University)",{"children":"No. Badge courses are recorded as BG, meaning badge earned, or NBG, meaning no badge earned. They do not affect the learner’s GPA. (Wichita State University)"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
30:["$","section","Can the badge guarantee a job or university admission?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Can the badge guarantee a job or university admission?"}],[["$","p","No credential can guarantee employment, promotion, internship selection, or university admission.",{"children":"No credential can guarantee employment, promotion, internship selection, or university admission."}],["$","p","Its value depends on:",{"children":"Its value depends on:"}],["$","p","The relevance of the selected course",{"children":"The relevance of the selected course"}],["$","p","Successful completion",{"children":"Successful completion"}],["$","p","The skills developed",{"children":"The skills developed"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
31:["$","section","Can I take more than one free badge?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Can I take more than one free badge?"}],[["$","p","Under this opportunity, each participant may register for one scholarship-supported badge course.",{"children":"Under this opportunity, each participant may register for one scholarship-supported badge course."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
32:["$","section","How long does the course take?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How long does the course take?"}],[["$","p","The international badge format is expected to involve approximately eight hours of learning, with additional time for homework and assignments. The precise workload can differ according to the course.",{"children":"The international badge format is expected to involve approximately eight hours of learning, with additional time for homework and assignments. The precise workload can differ according to the course."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
33:["$","section","Can badge credit be used toward a degree?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Can badge credit be used toward a degree?"}],[["$","p","In some cases, badge credit may be considered toward degree requirements, but this is not automatic. Approval depends on the program, academic requirements, and Wichita State University’s policies. (Wichita State University Catalog)",{"children":"In some cases, badge credit may be considered toward degree requirements, but this is not automatic. Approval depends on the program, academic requirements, and Wichita State University’s policies. (Wichita State University Catalog)"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
34:["$","section","Register for the Wichita State University Digital Badge Program 2026",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Register for the Wichita State University Digital Badge Program 2026"}],[["$","p","A small learning opportunity can become the beginning of a larger academic or professional journey.",{"children":"A small learning opportunity can become the beginning of a larger academic or professional journey."}],["$","p","The Wichita State University Digital Badge Program gives learners an accessible way to explore a new subject, develop a focused skill, experience international online learning, and add a university-issued credential to their profile.",{"children":"The Wichita State University Digital Badge Program gives learners an accessible way to explore a new subject, develop a focused skill, experience international online learning, and add a university-issued credential to their profile."}],["$","p","With limited scholarship-supported seats available, early registration is strongly recommended.",{"children":"With limited scholarship-supported seats available, early registration is strongly recommended."}],["$","p","Know More",{"children":"Know More"}],["$","p","https://onewindow.co/wsu/",{"children":"https://onewindow.co/wsu/"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
35:["$","section","https://zfrmz.in/TiBzKqos3D8wbTtTYC6u",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"https://zfrmz.in/TiBzKqos3D8wbTtTYC6u"}],[["$","p","For guidance in selecting a suitable badge and completing the registration process, connect with Team One Window.",{"children":"For guidance in selecting a suitable badge and completing the registration process, connect with Team One Window."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
